# 🔄 17. GAME STATE UPDATE

The **Game State System** is responsible for updating entity data.

Example:

```text
CHAR_000001
Level = 25
```

Hero gains EXP.

```text
GAME STATE SYSTEM
        │
        ▼
Level = 26
```

Then:

```text
GAME STATE SYSTEM
        │
        ▼
DATABASE SYSTEM
        │
        ▼
CHAR_000001
Level = 26
```

The ID itself does not change.

