# 🔍 25. ID LOOKUP

Other systems can request an entity using its ID.

Example:

```text
Find:

CHAR_000125
```

ID System:

```text
ID FOUND
```

Database System:

```text
LOAD CHAR_000125
```

Result:

```text
Character Data
```

If the ID does not exist:

```text
ID NOT FOUND
```

The system should return an appropriate error instead of creating an unexpected entity.

