# ⚠️ 26. ID VALIDATION

Every ID should pass validation.

Valid:

```text
CHAR_000125
```

Invalid examples:

```text
CHAR
CHAR_ABC
CHAR_12
CHAR_000125_EXTRA
```

depending on the implementation rules.

Validation should check:

```text
Prefix
Format
Length
Existence
Uniqueness
Namespace
```

