# 🏗️ 31. ID SYSTEM MODULES

Recommended architecture:

```text
ID SYSTEM
│
├── IDManager
│
├── IDGenerator
│
├── IDValidator
│
├── IDRegistry
│
├── IDResolver
│
├── IDHistory
└── IDPersistence
```

### IDManager

Central coordinator.

### IDGenerator

Creates new IDs.

### IDValidator

Validates IDs.

### IDRegistry

Tracks assigned IDs.

### IDResolver

Finds the entity associated with an ID.

### IDHistory

Tracks historical identity information.

### IDPersistence

Ensures registry data can survive game restarts.

